@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title Ring Design and Independent Design Request Detail
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

|Guest or Member|
start
:Open design entry;
if (Preview catalogue model/options?) then (yes)
  :Browse local preview;
  if (Protected action?) then (yes)
    :Prompt sign-in;
  endif
  stop
else (Continue)
  if (Authenticated Member?) then (yes)
    :Choose published model or blank design;
    :Configure parameters and preview locally;
    |System|
    :Validate options and limits;
    if (Save or evaluate succeeds?) then (yes)
      :Persist immutable design version;
      :Calculate advisory evaluation;
      :Show workshop recommendation;
      |Member|
      :Edit design, archive it, explore workshops or open consultation;
      if (Use design as custom-order reference?) then (yes)
        :Select optional saved design snapshot;
        :Add description and/or up to five images;
        :Give purpose-specific image consent;
        |System|
        :Validate image quality, ownership and request data;
        :Create NEED_REVIEW request;
        |Staff or Manager|
        :Review request by hand;
        |System|
        :Record Accepted, Rejected or Clarification Required
        with mandatory explanation;
        if (Accepted?) then (yes)
          |Staff or Manager|
          :Prepare custom-order quote;
          |Manager|
          :Approve quote;
          |Member|
          :Pay full amount before quote expiry;
          |System|
          :Verify payment and start production;
          |Staff or Manager|
          :Fulfil and close the custom order;
        endif
      endif
    else (no)
      :Show validation or conflict error;
    endif
  else (Guest)
    :Prompt sign-in;
  endif
endif

note right
Feature-012 saved designs are independent from booking and payment.
Feature-004 is Member-only and does not send images to an AI provider.
The recommendation is advisory; other workshop packages remain discoverable.
end note
stop
@enduml
